1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,265
Finally, use white light.

2
00:00:02,265 --> 00:00:11,250
At the centre, the path difference is zero for every colour, so every colour is bright there, and the central fringe is white.

3
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:18,138
Away from the centre, each colour has its own fringe width, violet the narrowest and red the widest.

4
00:00:18,138 --> 00:00:26,080
So you see a few coloured fringes, violet edges nearest the centre, before they overlap into a blur of white.

